<p>Hi!</p>
<p>With regards to your writing, there is a lot of work that needs to be done to help the piece read more smoothly. There are a number of reoccurring grammar and word choice errors (&quot;there&quot; = a place; &quot;it's&quot; = it is; its &amp; their = possessive) that make the piece very difficult to read. There are a large number of clunky, poorly structured sentences as well. On a stylistic note, the piece would also read better with less redaction and consistent formatting (the last log being left aligned instead of centered).</p>
<p>The concept is interesting and presents a good opportunity for an SCP. It certainly is a unique and clever idea to have a shower curtain that consumes people by hypnotically drawing them in. The idea just isn't executed well here because the draft was difficult to read from start to finish for the reasons I stated above.</p>
<p>I'm excited to see where you take it, so keep going!</p>

